<title>POLAND: DROSED PLANS NO 1996 DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>DROSED PLANS NO 1996 DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish poultry producer Drosed SA plans to earmark its entire 1996 net profit of 2.34 million zlotys to reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Drosed said the final decision on management's proposal would be taken at a general shareholders meeting on May 27.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
